Snipes reprised his role as Blade in the 2024 film Deadpool & Wolverine.

21
01:50:28,695 --> 01:50:34,695
The film explores themes of martial arts, hero,
vampire, superhero, supernatural.

22
01:55:44,347 --> 01:55:50,347
